# Changelog

## Unreleased

- Create an application-owned single-module [[.Layout]] skeleton with [[.Transport]]
  transports, explicit dependency assembly and lifecycle tests.
- Add contexts, services and native HTTP adapters on demand. Business behavior,
  authorization, persistence and behavior tests remain application-owned.
- Provide standalone Taskfile quality checks and matching CI entry points.
[[if .GRPC]]- Include opt-in Proto/gRPC contracts, explicit gateway mappings and pinned CLI
  generation/check tasks, without copied tool source or Python dependencies.
[[end]][[if .Agent]]- Include optional model configuration and bounded agent execution without
  predefined business tools or automatically exposed endpoints.
[[end]]
